{"id": "EUVD-2026-96925", "enisaUuid": "fecd477e-42b8-3a12-88f2-6b3ec917f7ef", "description": "LlamaFarm through 0.0.34 contains an insecure default configuration that binds its unauthenticated FastAPI server to 0.0.0.0 on port 14345, while the lf CLI silently discards HOST overrides. Network-adjacent attackers can call the project and dataset management API to read stored provider API keys, modify projects, trigger ingestion, and irreversibly delete projects.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T12:19:57", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T16:43:03", "baseScore": 7.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:A/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind03/llamafarm-default-all-interface-bind-unauthenticated-api", "https://github.com/llama-farm/llamafarm/blob/853e7eabdf70dd78054d93fabfa396452951377e/server/core/settings.py#L41-L42", "https://github.com/llama-farm/llamafarm/blob/853e7eabdf70dd78054d93fabfa396452951377e/cli/cmd/orchestrator/services.go#L138-L149", "https://github.com/llama-farm/llamafarm", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/llamafarm-through-0.0.34-unauthenticated-api-exposed-on-all-interfaces"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108760", "GHSA-fhw6-pmfp-fhhf"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0d892c06-ce34-36fb-b90e-7750cc63aa66", "product": {"name": "llamafarm", "vendor": {"name": "llama-farm"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.0.34"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "8f0e92c4-7b79-305f-bf65-66495be7a663", "vendor": {"name": "llama-farm"}}], "isExploited": false}